{'symbol': 'CBOE', 'date': '2021-12-09 14:29:00', 'title': 'MCELHENNY SHEFFIELD CAPITAL MANAGEMENT LAUNCHES THE MCELHENNY SHEFFIELD MANAGED RISK ETF (CBOE: MSMR)', 'text': "DALLAS, DEC. 9, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0 MCELHENNY SHEFFIELD CAPITAL MANAGEMENT, LLC (MSCM) ANNOUNCES THE LAUNCH OF THE MCELHENNY SHEFFIELD MANAGED RISK ETF (CBOE: MSMR), AN ACTIVELY-MANAGED EXCHANGE-TRADED FUND (ETF) TARGETING U.S. STOCKS WITH A FOCUS ON MANAGING RISK THROUGH TACTICAL RULES-BASED STRATEGIES. THE LAUNCH OF MSMR ADDS TO THE FIRM'S GROWING INVESTMENT MANAGEMENT OFFERINGS, AS THE FIRM RECENTLY SURPASSED $400 MILLION IN ASSETS UNDER MANAGEMENT ACROSS ITS DIRECT-CLIENT AND SUBADVISORY BUSINESS."}